Effects CapCut users often confuse with video effects

These may appear elsewhere in the app or in nearby menus:

| Feature type | What it is | Not exactly the same as video effects |
|---|---|---|
| Filters | Overall color/style presets | More like global look adjustments |
| Transitions | Animation between clips | Applied between clips, not over a clip |
| Animations | In/out/combo motion | Move the clip itself |
| Adjustments | Brightness, contrast, HSL, etc. | Editing controls, not effect presets |
| Body effects | Face/body tracking and stylization | Sometimes separate from standard video effects |
| Templates | Prebuilt effect stacks | Not individual manual effects |

